{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113071","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113071/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113071/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113071/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113071","id":3655380100,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7Z4KyE","number":113071,"title":"@export_range does not create a slider for ints by default","user":{"login":"SamDevelopsCode","id":122749374,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1EBvg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122749374?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode","html_url":"https://github.com/SamDevelopsCode","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamDevelopsCode/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-11-23T01:54:15Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T09:45:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.5.1 and 4.6-dev3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev3 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 9 275HX (24 threads) - 31.41 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen trying to do the following line of code, the editor defaults to the normal input box, not a slider.\n\n`@export_range(0, 10, 1) var my_number: int`\n<img width=\"321\" height=\"53\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ebab199-5212-4cd5-b5ca-b80120906b90\" />\n\nChanging it to a float, a slider is used.\n`@export_range(0, 10, 1) var my_number: float`\n<img width=\"321\" height=\"52\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f764ffed-19e2-4d4c-ad37-116a8a91cee6\" />\n\nNow the following code does work correctly with ints\n`@export_range(0, 10, 1, \"prefer_slider\") var my_number: int`\n<img width=\"331\" height=\"47\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/665ee77d-a248-440d-92b1-805f9e1dff58\" />\n\nWhile its great we have \"prefer slider\" I feel like we need to be consistent. Why do floats have a slider for the range by default but ints use the inputbox? \n\nA good change would be to have both of them follow a consistent behavior. So when using the base `@export_range()` floats and ints both default to a slider, or defaults to the input box. Personally I like sliders more for ranges but I am not everyone.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd the following line of code to any script -> `@export_range(0, 10, 1) var my_number: int`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIts such a trivial thing to test an entire project is not needed.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113071/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113071/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}